<title>EGYPT: Abu Qir results at end-Q3 1996/7.</title>
<headline>Abu Qir results at end-Q3 1996/7.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are profit/loss accounts released by Abu Qir Fertilisers and Chemical Industries at the end of the third quarter of the financial year 1996/7, which started on July 1. All figures are in Egyptian pounds (comparative figures from the previous year in brackets where available):</p>
<p>Net sales			   451,242,000</p>
<p>Production costs		  234,808,000</p>
<p>Overheads			    37,481,000</p>
<p>Exceptional revenue		49,374,000</p>
<p>Exceptional expenses	     ----------</p>
<p>Net profit/loss before tax   +228,327,000</p>
<p>($1 =3.395 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
